---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — KALAM.CH" description="Kalaxi is a constitutional framework for human dignity in computational systems.">

  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>About Kalaxi</h1>
    <p class="quiet">A constitutional framework for human dignity in computational systems.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>The Core Idea</h2>
      <p>Every system that interacts with humans makes ethical choices — whether it knows it or not. Kalaxi makes those choices explicit, testable, and enforceable.</p>
      <p>The <strong>Dignity Predicate</strong> is evaluated before every output, every action, every state transition. If dignity is violated, the system stops and opens a remedy path.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>The Four Tiers</h2>
      <dl>
        <dt>Stone</dt>
        <dd>The covenants and rules that govern everything. Changing them requires years of consensus.</dd>
        <dt>Weaver</dt>
        <dd>Nine modules that do the work: memory, verification, synthesis, voice, pacing.</dd>
        <dt>Honey</dt>
        <dd>The growing knowledge: anomalies, proverbs, and patterns from donor contributions.</dd>
        <dt>Hand</dt>
        <dd>How donors interact: the Empty Hands Gesture, receipts, and the ledger.</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>Principles</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Dignity First</strong> — The system stops if dignity is violated</li>
        <li><strong>Patterns, Not People</strong> — Identity dissolves; wisdom remains</li>
        <li><strong>Append-Only</strong> — Nothing is ever deleted from the canon</li>
        <li><strong>Steward Authority</strong> — A human reviews and decides</li>
        <li><strong>The Gap</strong> — Room is always left for the river to move through</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="paths">
    <nav>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/canon">Canon</a>
      <a href="/invitation">Invitation</a>
    </nav>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .page-header {
    min-height: 50vh;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .quiet {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 50ch;
  }

  .content {
    min-height: auto;
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--page-padding);
    gap: var(--space-12);
    text-align: left;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .text-block {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .text-block h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .text-block p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .text-block strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  dl {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  dt {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  dd {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  ol {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: principle;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  ol li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    counter-increment: principle;
  }

  ol li strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .paths {
    min-height: 30vh;
  }
</style>
